t for="L1">在这座桥的彼岸</text><text for="L2">若有喜悦在等待 啊</text><text for="L3">啊 任风吹拂 感受痛楚</text><text for="L4">此刻哭泣也无妨</text><text for="L5">为我流泪吧</text><text for="L6">纵然时光流逝</text><text for="L7">痛楚却接踵而至</text><text for="L8">一次次撕裂我的心</text><text for="L9">明天永远无人知晓</text><text for="L10">那曾失去的希望</text><text for="L11">我只愿未来的自己有所不同</text><text for="L12">背负孤独 亲手为心上锁</text><text for="L13">我惧怕失去 也惧怕得到</text><text for="L14">循着泪滴淌过的痕迹</text><text for="L15">有我最真实的笑容</text><text for="L16">那才是我的方向</text><text for="L17">在这座桥的彼岸</text><text for="L18">若有喜悦在等待 啊</text><text for="L19">啊 任风吹过 感受痛楚</text><text for="L20">此刻尽可以哭泣</text><text for="L21">为我流泪吧</text><text for="L22">想念心爱的人</text><text for="L23">为自己的愚昧而哭</text><text for="L24">为寂寞而哭</text><text for="L25">为喜悦而哭</text><text for="L26">我为我自己流泪</text><text for="L27">滴落的泪向未来诉说</text><text for="L28">满溢的思绪将催开花朵</text><text for="L29">直到那一天 明日再来</text><text for="L30">直到风暴渐渐远去</text><text for="L31">在这座桥的彼岸</text><text for="L32">若有喜悦在等待 啊</text><text for="L33">啊 任风吹拂 感受痛楚</text><text for="L34">此刻哭泣也无妨</text><text for="L35">为我流泪吧</text><text for="L36">这座桥的</text><text for="L37">另一端</text><text for="L38">若有喜悦在等待 啊</text><text for="L39">只为我自己</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:55.265"><div begin="0:43.391" end="3:55.265"><p begin="0:43.391" end="0:48.396" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.391" end="0:43.776">こ</span><span begin="0:43.776" end="0:44.076">の</span><span begin="0:44.076" end="0:44.766">橋</span><span begin="0:44.766" end="0:45.816">の</span><span begin="0:46.066" end="0:46.686">向</span><span begin="0:46.686" end="0:47.386">こう</span><span begin="0:47.386" end="0:48.396">に</span></p><p begin="0:48.686" end="0:53.086" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.686" end="0:49.686">喜</span><span begin="0:49.686" end="0:50.196">び</span><span begin="0:50.196" end="0:50.456">が</span> <span begin="0:50.706" end="0:51.096">ああ</span> <span begin="0:51.306" end="0:51.606">待</span><span begin="0:51.606" end="0:51.996">つ</span><span begin="0:51.996" end="0:52.316">の</span><span begin="0:52.316" end="0:52.646">な</span><span begin="0:52.646" end="0:53.086">ら</span></p><p begin="0:53.334" end="0:58.884" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.334" end="0:53.734">ああ</span> <span begin="0:53.924" end="0:54.644">風</span><span begin="0:54.644" end="0:54.774">に</span><span begin="0:54.774" end="0:54.934">吹</span><span begin="0:54.934" end="0:55.284">か</span><span begin="0:55.284" end="0:56.294">れ</span><span begin="0:56.584" end="0:56.904">痛</span><span begin="0:56.904" end="0:57.214">み</span><span begin="0:57.214" end="0:57.364">を</span><span begin="0:57.364" end="0:57.724">感</span><span begin="0:57.724" end="0:57.874">じ</span><span begin="0:57.874" end="0:58.884">て</span></p><p begin="0:59.209" end="1:02.229" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.209" end="0:59.699">今</span><span begin="0:59.699" end="1:00.289">は</span><span begin="1:00.489" end="1:00.829">泣い</span><span begin="1:00.829" end="1:01.159">て</span><span begin="1:01.159" end="1:01.579">も</span><span begin="1:01.579" end="1:02.229">いい</span></p><p begin="1:02.431" end="1:04.381" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.431" end="1:02.781">Cry</span> <span begin="1:02.781" end="1:03.241">for</span> <span begin="1:03.241" end="1:04.381">me</span></p><p begin="1:04.381" end="1:06.871" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:04.381" end="1:04.771">Time</span> <span begin="1:04.771" end="1:05.771">goes</span> <span begin="1:05.771" end="1:06.871">though</span></p><p begin="1:07.089" end="1:09.299" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:07.089" end="1:07.389">痛</span><span begin="1:07.389" end="1:07.549">み</span><span begin="1:07.549" end="1:07.699">は</span><span begin="1:07.699" end="1:08.189">次</span><span begin="1:08.189" end="1:08.549">々</span><span begin="1:08.549" end="1:09.299">と</span></p><p begin="1:09.711" end="1:14.601" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent