>心</span><span begin="1:27.249" end="1:27.419">に</span><span begin="1:27.419" end="1:27.909">自</span><span begin="1:27.909" end="1:28.029">ら</span><span begin="1:28.029" end="1:28.209">か</span><span begin="1:28.209" end="1:28.539">け</span><span begin="1:28.539" end="1:28.709">た</span><span begin="1:28.709" end="1:29.219">鍵</span></p><p begin="1:29.416" end="1:34.366" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:29.416" end="1:29.676">何</span><span begin="1:29.676" end="1:30.086">か</span><span begin="1:30.086" end="1:30.256">を</span><span begin="1:30.256" end="1:30.916">失</span><span begin="1:30.916" end="1:31.596">い</span> <span begin="1:32.026" end="1:32.156">得</span><span begin="1:32.156" end="1:32.306">る</span><span begin="1:32.306" end="1:32.476">こ</span><span begin="1:32.476" end="1:32.646">と</span><span begin="1:32.646" end="1:32.836">に</span><span begin="1:32.836" end="1:33.366">怯</span><span begin="1:33.366" end="1:33.516">え</span><span begin="1:33.516" end="1:33.796">る</span><span begin="1:33.796" end="1:34.366">私</span></p><p begin="1:34.632" end="1:37.022" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:34.632" end="1:34.972">辿</span><span begin="1:34.972" end="1:35.252">る</span><span begin="1:35.252" end="1:36.132">雫</span><span begin="1:36.132" end="1:36.642">の</span><span begin="1:36.642" end="1:36.752">あ</span><span begin="1:36.752" end="1:37.022">と</span></p><p begin="1:37.263" end="1:42.213" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:37.263" end="1:37.893">本</span><span begin="1:37.893" end="1:38.223">当</span><span begin="1:38.223" end="1:38.583">の</span><span begin="1:38.583" end="1:39.363">私</span><span begin="1:39.363" end="1:39.723">の</span><span begin="1:39.943" end="1:40.193">笑</span><span begin="1:40.193" end="1:40.853">顔</span><span begin="1:40.853" end="1:41.233">が</span><span begin="1:41.233" end="1:41.383">あ</span><span begin="1:41.383" end="1:41.803">る</span><span begin="1:41.803" end="1:41.973">こ</span><span begin="1:41.973" end="1